msgstr "<span id=\"pass-options\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set Executor options {#set-executor-options}"
msgstr "Tetapkan pilihan Executor {#set-executor-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If an option is specified both during and after primitive initialization, "
"the value set after initializing the primitive is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika pilihan ditentukan semasa dan selepas permulaan primitif, nilai yang "
"ditetapkan selepas memulakan primitif digunakan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Primitive initialization {#primitive-initialization}"
msgstr "Permulaan primitif {#primitive-initialization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can pass in an instance of the options class or a dictionary when "
"initializing Executor, which then makes a copy of those options. Thus, "
"changing the original dictionary or options instance doesn't affect the "
"options owned by the primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menghantar instans kelas pilihan atau kamus apabila memulakan "
"Executor, yang kemudian membuat salinan pilihan tersebut. Oleh itu, menukar "
"kamus asal atau instans pilihan tidak mempengaruhi pilihan yang dimiliki "
"oleh primitif.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Options class {#options-class}"
msgstr "Kelas pilihan {#options-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When creating an instance of the `Executor` class, you can pass in an "
"instance of the options class. Those options are then applied when you use "
"`run()` to perform the calculation.  Specify the options in this format:  "
"`options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`.  For example: "
"`options.environment.log_level = INFO`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila mencipta instans kelas `Executor`, anda boleh menghantar instans "
"kelas pilihan. Pilihan-pilihan tersebut kemudian diterapkan apabila anda "
"menggunakan `run()` untuk melakukan pengiraan. Tentukan pilihan dalam format"
" ini: `options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`. Sebagai contoh: "
"`options.environment.log_level = INFO`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Contoh:\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Dictionary {#dictionary}"
msgstr "Kamus {#dictionary}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can specify options as a dictionary when initializing Executor.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menentukan pilihan sebagai kamus apabila memulakan Executor.\n"

